---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title={'About'} description={'About Phoenix I/O LLC, a senior software, data and AI engineering firm in New Brunswick, New Jersey.'} page="about">
<section class="page" id="p-about" data-title="About">
  <div class="pagehead"><div class="wrap"><span class="label">About</span><h1>Built for systems where failure isn't an option.</h1><p class="lede">Phoenix I/O LLC builds and modernizes mission-critical software and data systems for organizations where downtime, data errors and security gaps are not acceptable.</p></div></div>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="block"><span class="label">Company overview</span><p style="font-size:1.12rem;color:var(--text);max-width:68ch">Phoenix I/O LLC builds and modernizes mission-critical software and data systems: cloud data platforms, secure full-stack and mobile applications, high-performance distributed services, and AI-enabled automation. Five senior principals, each with 20+ years of hands-on delivery, bring experience from healthcare, public health, logistics, financial services and enterprise e-commerce.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="metrics">
        <div class="m"><span class="n">5</span><p>senior principals</p></div>
        <div class="m"><span class="n">20<i>+</i></span><p>years of hands-on delivery each</p></div>
        <div class="m"><span class="n">100<i>+</i></span><p>combined years of engineering</p></div>
        <div class="m"><span class="n">NJ</span><p>New Brunswick headquarters</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="head"><div class="stack"><span class="label">How we work</span><h2>Three commitments.</h2></div><p>Industries served: healthcare, public health, logistics, financial services and enterprise e-commerce.</p></div>
      <div class="principles p3">
        <div class="pr"><span class="label">No hand-off</span><h3>The people who scope it build it.</h3><p>No sales layer. The principal who writes the plan writes the code.</p></div>
        <div class="pr"><span class="label">AI + human</span><h3>AI-assisted, human-reviewed.</h3><p>AI speeds up delivery. A senior engineer reviews every change before it ships.</p></div>
        <div class="pr"><span class="label">Secure by design</span><h3>Security from day one.</h3><p>Access control, audit logging and data protection are designed in, not bolted on.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</section>
</Base>
